    "description": "Vintage Chalet Market Montana Sausage Box with Rocks Minerals Fossils Lot\nThis listing includes a vintage Chalet Market of Montana sausage box repurposed as a storage container for a collection of rocks, minerals, and possible fossil specimens. The assortment features various petrified wood, agate, jasper, obsidian, quartz, and other stones. Some pieces are shaped or fractured, suggesting ancient tools or natural artifacts. Specimens range from small chips to larger fragments and are presented both loose and within a small plastic display case. The box shows significant wear and tape residue, while the stones are unpolished with natural variations and textures. Suitable for collectors, geology enthusiasts, or educational use.\nProduct Size:\n10.5 x 2.5 x 8.25 in\n4.2 lb",
